<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>3</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>5</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>Launching a Private View</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>Launching a View that is not listed on the navigator</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='italic' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>NOTE: Although this Help document was created specifically for the Hecs Orders database and includes examples from the HECS Orders database, the procedure is similar for any Notes database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='italic' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>NOTE: Private Views cannot be shared, and cannot be emailed to others.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1. Launch the HECS Orders database</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2. Views that are used often are listed in the navigator on the left-hand-side of the screen.  Other views exist, both public views and private views, and they can be launched like so:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	2.1 On the top menu bar, select View, the GoTo</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	2.2 in the Listbox, select the view of interest then click OK.  Note that the Public views ar elisted first, alphabetically; they are followed by the PRIVATE views, alphabetically.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='62%'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpESubject'><text>Launching a (private) view</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubject'><text>to translate</text></item></document>

